								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=117.msg1649#msg1649">Re: VHI Hiphop Honors - tomorrow night - Tuesday the 17th </a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #30 on:</b> October 18, 2006, 09:31:12 am &#187;</div></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
