								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=117.msg1707#msg1707">Re: VHI Hiphop Honors - tomorrow night - Tuesday the 17th </a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #38 on:</b> October 18, 2006, 07:22:49 pm &#187;</div></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">That show was for squares. i didnt see the whole thing but what i did see i was saddned. I wasnt surprised though. ICE T sucks...and i figured it would be dumb anyway...i did catch &quot;RAP SCHOOL&quot; afterward and it was one of the dumbest things ive ever seen. What is the point??? I dont see the reasoning behind sending an over-the-hill rapper to &quot;teach kids hot to rap&quot;.Hip hop shouldnt be something you shove onto people who are completely clueless...they cant even snap to a beat.Not to mention the way these kids are being taught....did anyone see their attire? k well yea it was one of the worst shows ive ever seen.<br />REDICULOUS.</div>
